  "prefLabel": "Pes 101.37 \"Surface waters\" mean streams, brooks, creeks, rivers, lakes, ponds, wetlands and tidal waters within the jurisdiction of the state, including all streams, lake",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Pes 101.37 \"Surface waters\" mean streams, brooks, creeks, rivers, lakes, ponds, wetlands and tidal waters within the jurisdiction of the state, including all streams, lakes or ponds bordering on the state, marshes, watercourses and other bodies of water, natural or artificial.\n\nSource. #150, eff l-9-74; ss by #2209, eff 12-13-82; ss by #2781, eff 7-26-84; ss by #4867, eff 7-19-90; ss by #6239, eff 5-2-96; renumbered by #9923 (from Pes 102.36)",
